---

The .nanow container format in this repository redistributes the numerical
weights of the BitNet b1.58 700M checkpoint published by the 1bitLLM project:

    https://huggingface.co/1bitLLM/bitnet_b1_58-large

That checkpoint is released under the MIT License, and it is a reproduction of
"The Era of 1-bit LLMs: All Large Language Models are in 1.58 Bits"
(arXiv:2402.17764) trained on the RedPajama dataset for 100B tokens. Its license
and attribution are preserved here and in the model repository.
